is something to try only if you know what you're doing.  Of course
you know whether your genocide scrolls are blessed or cursed, as you've
either written them yourself, or identified them, or dropped them 
on an altar.  The one exception would be if you're identifying scrolls
by reading them, in which case I'd recommend picking something annoying
but non-lethal like gremlins or rust monsters.  That way you don't die
